OL,3,ANorthern Ireland's young drivers first
OL,4,Ain UK to get new driving licensing laws
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland has become the first
OL,7,Fpart of the UK to introduce new rules
OL,8,Ffor new drivers in a bid to reduce
OL,9,Ffatal road crashes involving young
OL,10,Fpeople.
OL,12,FGraduated driver licensing (GDL), for
OL,13,Flearner and newly qualified drivers,
OL,14,Fapplies to all new drivers but is
OL,15,Fparticularly aimed at 17 to
OL,16,F23-year-olds.
OL,18,FAmong the new rules is that learners
OL,19,Fmust spend at least six months getting
OL,20,Fdriving experience before they can take
OL,21,Fa practical test.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
