OL,3,ANorthern Ireland's young drivers first
OL,4,Ain UK to get new driving licensing laws
OL,5,
OL,6,FNewly qualified drivers under 24 will
OL,7,Falso face restrictions on carrying
OL,8,Fyoung passengers at night.
